<title>USA: Piercing Pagoda Q1 sales rise.</title>
<headline>Piercing Pagoda Q1 sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>BETHLEHEM, Pa. 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piercing Pagoda Inc said Tuesday that net sales for the first quarter of fiscal 1998 ended June 30 were $42.9 milion, an increase of 42 percent from net sales of $30.2 million in the prior year period.</p>
<p>Comparable store net sales increased six percent in the quarter, the company said.</p>
<p>It said it ended the quarter with 749 stores open, up from 535 stores open at June 30, 1996. Piercing Pagoda is a retailer of gold jewelry through kiosk stores.</p>
</text>
